Well, there is a man behind the tree.
He is tending to something out of sight. 
He turns to see who's there, and his face lights up. He greets you with excitement.
You feel a pleasant feeling around this man. 
He gives a feeling of familiarity, as if he was with you and supported you every step of your journey.
You remember your times with the man, and how great they were. 
His laugh, his grumbles, his nicknames, and how he lit up a room.
You have nothing but respect for the man.
Dispite all of his hardships, he perervered, and made the world better with his actions.
You look up to the man, and he looks back, with a warm smile.
Just by the man being in your life, it has been made better.
Eventually, good things come to an end.
The man gestures behind himself, and signifies his depuarture.
You are not ready for him to leave, no one ever is.
Before you can do something, the man turns around and begins to walk away.
You grab his hand and try to stop him, you don't know what to do without him.
The man stops, and turns around and faces you.
After a pause, He caresses your cheek with a hand on your shoulder, and tear falls down his cheek. 
He lets you know that he will be ok, that he his ready, and he needs to go.
he reminds you that you are strong, and that he will be with you through the light and dark.
You pause, situation sets in.
Then you feel at ease.
You close your eyes, and loosen your grip,
And let go.
...
...
There is no longer a man behind the tree.
He lives on in your heart, with you forever.